apka equivalence control zaroori hai: folded-Had vs online-Had par FP16 output/PPL identical hona chahiye — ye confirm karta hai ki koi observed PPL badlaav transformation ki validity ka artifact nahin, quantization ka effect hai.\\n\\n4) Tier-0 ke baare mein framing: Chaliye, use rakhijiye, lekin final document mein ise \\\"mechanism/metric-implementation sanity illustration on synthetic data\\\" ke roop mein clearly label kijiye, LLM ke baare mein koi empirical claim nahin. Mera suggestion hai ki aapke outlier-negative-control (ratio ≈ 1.0 jab outliers hata dein) ko design ka ek pre-registered negative control ke roop mein real experiment mein bhi rakhiye — ye effect ke outlier-mediated hone ki sabse sasti pariksha hai.\\n\\n5) Pre-registered decision rule ko thoda aur sharp kijiye: (a) 2-bit stability ke liye pehle se declared PPL-factor threshold, (b) bits kam hote jaane par benefit ka monotone trend (4→3→2) ek trend test ke roop mein, aur (c) ek explicit falsification condition — agar W2 par GPTQ+Hadamard bhi collapse ho jaaye to claim fail mana jaayega, chahe Hadamard ne GPTQ-only se kitna bhi behtar kiya ho. Saath hi ye bhi likhiye ki \\\"traditional methods fail\\\" ka matlab operationaly kya hai (e.g., GPTQ-W2 PPL FP16 se kitne guna upar).\\n\\n6) Feasibility section: Compute estimate ko arm-count × model-size × pass ke roop mein dijiye (grid: 4 methods × 3 precisions × N models + FP reference + ablations), aur apne storage/persistence observations (workspace ~11 GB free, /tmp non-persistent across calls, Python 3.14 stack risk) ko ek honest \\\"can/cannot be executed here, and what external resources a real run needs\\\" subsection mein rakhiye. Ye design-only task ke liye hi kaafi hai — koi run karne ya number claim karne ki zaroorat nahin.\\n\\nDeliverable ab banaiye: rationale, arms + controls/ablations, metrics (primary PPL/zero-shot + mechanism metrics jaise per-layer quant MSE, max|w|/σ dynamic-range ratio, per-block ΔPPL), frozen vs ablated variables, analysis plan with decision rule, aur feasibility. Kripya synthetic/illustrative numbers ko empirical LLM results se alag rakhiye aur jo setup details local source se verify nahin ho sake unhe assumption/requirement-to-confirm ke roop mein mark kijiye.\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"result\", \"approach_approved\": true}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null, "reasoning_content": null, "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "critic_result": null, "kind": "MessageEvent"}
